  "content": "<h1>采掘之脉附魔</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=discord&color=blue&logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fly-veinminer-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/ly-veinminer-enchantment?label=modrinth&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/lullaby6/data-packs\" alt=\"License\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flullaby45743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/ko--fi-donate-ff5f5f?logo=ko-fi\" alt=\"Donate\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252flucianobrumer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://shields.io/badge/paypal-donate-ff5f5f?logo=paypal&color=blue\" alt=\"Donate\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>📖 描述</h2>\n<p>全新的镐子附魔，能够挖掘多个相连的相同矿石（仅针对原版镐子和原石）！</p>\n<p>与幸运和时运附魔兼容！</p>\n<p>与流行的“采掘之脉”数据包有何不同？区别如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>更出色的性能。</li>\n<li>无需其他数据包即可运行。</li>\n<li>每次额外挖掘一个方块，镐子的耐久度都会减少。</li>\n<li>如果被你挖掘的方块会掉落经验值，那么相邻的方块也会掉落经验值。</li>\n<li>与 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fsmelting-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">冶炼</a> 和 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fmagnetic-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">磁力</a> 附魔兼容！</li>\n</ul>\n<p>玩家可以通过附魔台、宝箱或村民交易获得此附魔。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>⚠️ 不兼容项</h2>\n<p>与以下模组不兼容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fconfigurable-despawn-timer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">可配置的自动消散计时器</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fquad\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quad</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>⌨️ 命令</h2>\n<p>给予物品：</p>\n<pre><code>/loot give @s loot veinminer_enchantment:veinminer</code></pre>\n<p>施加附魔：</p>\n<pre><code>/enchant @s veinminer_enchantment:veinminer</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>🪪 许可协议</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL-3.0-or-later</a></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h2>👾 Bug报告</h2>\n<p>请在 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord服务器</a> 上报告任何问题或Bug。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>💌 捐赠</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flullaby45743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在Ko-Fi上捐赠</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252flucianobrumer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">在PayPal上捐赠</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e840cd99-59f6-4b27-b542-3023cd08bdfe.webp\" alt=\"Server Hosting\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252flullaby\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bisecthosting.com/lullaby</a></p>\n<p>创建自己的服务器可能是一个漫长、繁琐且昂贵的过程。</p>\n<p>但在BisectHosting的帮助下，您只需点击几下即可拥有专属服务器！凭借其全天候支持和快速响应速度，任何问题都无法阻碍您的步伐！对此感兴趣吗？那我们就为您准备了优惠方案！</p>",
